Each platform that this extension has been built to support should have a folder
in this directory containing its native code.

  windows/   — my-project.x86_64.dll, vcruntime140.dll
  linux/     — libmy-project.x86_64.so
  macos/     — libmy-project.x86_64.dylib, libmy-project.arm64.dylib
  ios/       — libmy-project.arm64.dylib
  android/   — libmy-project.arm64.so, libmy-project.x86_64.so

Folders are created automatically by `just build` when building for that platform.
